    "message": "Renamed to EntityFrameworkCore.Exceptions.MySqlConnector: the package works with any MySqlConnector-based provider (Pomelo, Microting.EntityFrameworkCore.MySql and other forks). See https://github.com/Giorgi/EntityFramework.Exceptions#mysqlconnector-based-providers",
